# Dhan access tokens live exactly 24 hours and no long-lived credential can
# replace them: the 12-month API key only MINTS a token, and minting needs an
# interactive browser login with 2FA. GET /v2/RenewToken is the only
# automatable path, and it only extends a token that is still ACTIVE.
#
# BOTH RUNS RENEW UNCONDITIONALLY (threshold 25h > the 24h token life), and
# that is the whole point rather than an oversight. Renewing at ONE fixed
# time a day sets the new expiry to that same time tomorrow, so the next
# day's run fires exactly ON the boundary - simulated across a full week, a
# single 22:00 run had Tuesday's renewal racing Tuesday's expiry at 0.0h.
# Two unconditional runs 8.8h and 15.2h apart mean the clock is reset long
# before it ever runs down. Renewing early costs nothing.
#
# TIMED TO THE EC2 SCHEDULE AND TO MARKET HOURS. The instance runs
# 08:15-23:55 IST Mon-Fri and cron does not catch up runs missed while it is
# off, so both slots sit inside that window. Each renewal restarts api and
# worker (~6s), so both are placed outside trading: 02:50 UTC = 08:20 IST is
# before MCX opens at 09:00 and NSE at 09:14; 18:05 UTC = 23:35 IST is after
# MCX closes at 23:30, with 20 minutes to spare before shutdown.
#
# WEEKENDS ARE NOT SOLVABLE HERE. Fri 23:55 -> Mon 08:15 is 56.3h against a
# 24h token, so Friday's token is expired before Monday and an expired token
# cannot be renewed, only regenerated by hand at web.dhan.co. Generating one
# on Sunday (any time after ~08:15 Sunday) carries the week: Monday's 08:20
# run picks it up and every run after that keeps it alive to Friday. Monday's
# run will FAIL loudly with MANUAL ACTION REQUIRED if that has not been done.
# Do not "fix" this with weekend entries - the box is off.
#
# Output goes to a log (no MTA on this host); the script exits non-zero and
# logs a FAILED line on every failure path, which is the alerting surface.
50 2 * * 1-5 root /opt/option-decode/ops/scripts/dhan-token-renew.sh --threshold-hours 25 >> /opt/option-decode-native/logs/dhan-token-renew.log 2>&1
5 18 * * 1-5 root /opt/option-decode/ops/scripts/dhan-token-renew.sh --threshold-hours 25 >> /opt/option-decode-native/logs/dhan-token-renew.log 2>&1
